[Trigger]
Name	siege
Mode	once
Cond	time	3
Action	message	1	The capital, master. High King Castellan sits on his throne at the top of three walled courts, and the heroes of the whole kingdom are marching to defend him.
Action	objective	1	Kill High King Castellan on his throne.
Action	objective	1	Break through the three courts; the upper gates are sealed and open when the towers of each court have fallen.
Action	objective	1	Survive the heroes who will not stop coming.
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	campHeld
Mode	once
Cond	claimed	1	Camp	30
Action	message	1	Your camp is secure. The first gate stands open to the north and mines lie east and west.
Action	reveal	1	FirstGate
Action	reveal	1	WestMine
Action	reveal	1	EastMine
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	mineSeen
Mode	once
Cond	region	1	WestMine
Cond	region	1	EastMine
Action	message	1	Both mines are in your hands. The old kings stored coin here against a siege.
Action	gold	1	1500
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	firstGate
Mode	once
Cond	region	1	FirstGate
Action	message	1	The first gate. A stone span crosses a trench of lava and the court beyond it is full of colonnades.
Action	reveal	1	GateCourt
Action	spawn	4	57	75	1	Knight:4	Elf:4	Monk:4	Adventurer:4
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	gateCourt
Mode	once
Cond	region	1	GateCourt
Action	message	1	The gate court. The towers on both flanks hold the treasuries of the garrison. The second gate is sealed shut.
Action	reveal	1	WestTower1
Action	reveal	1	EastTower1
Action	reveal	1	SecondGate
[/Trigger]
